# Title: Microsoft IIS Service Account Password Dumped
# ID: 2d3cdeec-c0db-45b4-aa86-082f7eb75701
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Tim Rauch, Janantha Marasinghe, Elastic (original idea)
# Date: 2022-11-08
# Tags: attack.credential-access, attack.t1003
# Description: Detects the Internet Information Services (IIS) command-line tool, AppCmd, being used to list passwords
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((CommandLine contains "list ") AND ((Image="*\\appcmd.exe") OR (OriginalFileName equals "appcmd.exe"))) AND (((CommandLine contains " /config" OR CommandLine contains " /xml" OR CommandLine contains " -config" OR CommandLine contains " -xml")) OR (((CommandLine contains " /@t" OR CommandLine contains " /text" OR CommandLine contains " /show" OR CommandLine contains " -@t" OR CommandLine contains " -text" OR CommandLine contains " -show")) AND ((CommandLine contains ":\\*" OR CommandLine contains "password")))))
